4:     * 【2†Volvic International†www.volvic.com】\nL65:     * 【3†Volvic France†www.volvic.fr】\nL66:     * 【4†Volvic United Kingdom】\nL67:     * 【5†Volvic Switzerland (DE)†www.volvic.ch】\nL68:     * 【6†Volvic Switzerland (FR)†www.volvic.ch】\nL69:     * 【7†Volvic Belgium (FR)†www.volvic.com】\nL70:     * 【8†Volvic Belgium (NL)†www.volvic.com】\nL71: \nL72: 【23†Image】\nL73: # Composition of Volvic Natural Mineral Water\nL74: \nL75: ## The mineralisation: exceptional and unique\nL76: \nL77: Nature and time give Volvic Natural Mineral Water its unique Volcanic taste. The slow filtering of the water through six layers of volcanic rock over multiple years ensures its purity and its specific mineral composition, making Volvic a unique Volcanic Water.\nL78: ## A composition fully protected by the volcano\nL79: \nL80: 【24†Image】\nL81: \nL82: The Volvic Natural Mineral Water impluvium is made up of several layers of various volcanic rock types. Its huge natural filter was formed by lava originating from several volcanoes and the prolonged time it takes passing through these filters gives Volvic Natural Mineral Water its unique mineral content.\nL83: \nL84:   * 【9†Products】\nL85: \nL86:   * 【14†Our water】\nL87: \nL88:   * 【16†Sustainability】\nL89: \nL90:   * 【19†Recipes】\nL91: \nL92:   * Free helpline\nL93:   * * * *\nL94: \nL95:   * © Volvic 2026\nL96:   * Follow us on Social media\nL97:   * Nutricia Limited registered in England and Wales under the company registration number 00275552.\nL98: Registered office address: Newmarket Avenue, Whitehorse Business Park, Trowbridge, Wiltshire, BA14 0XQ\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nChecking your browser - reCAPTCHA (https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC89789/)\nciteturn46view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC89789/\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 3\nL0: Checking your browser before 